			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750330201,
					"content": "來跟我的孩子飛一次吧，年輕人，跟花羽會的飛行好手一起競速的機會可不多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330202,
					"content": "去追追看賽道上的<color=#00E1FFFF>飛行火炬</color>，誰先追到誰就是贏家，這幾個孩子還小的時候我就是這樣訓練他們的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330203,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>火炬被一個氣球提著，點綴著紅色的羽毛</color>，象徵著勇士應當承擔的責任與榮譽，是我做給他們的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330204,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}看了就可以認出來，怎麼樣，來試試看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330205,
						750330207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330205,
					"content": "我準備好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330206,
					"content": "哈哈好，那就去起點預備吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 750330207,
					"content": "我還要再準備一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750330208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750330208,
					"content": "#那我們就等{F#妳}{M#你}準備好再說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "庫約尼"
				}
			]
		},
